WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.069
Today is for the child who remembers a line, and says it without looking.

2
00:00:04.519 --> 00:00:07.098
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:07.598 --> 00:00:12.080
Each sentence on the page comes twice. The same words, in a new order.

4
00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:13.798
A cat sat on a mat.

5
00:00:14.498 --> 00:00:15.741
A mat sat on a cat.

6
00:00:16.641 --> 00:00:22.799
The second one is silly on purpose. A child who says the line from memory gets it wrong, and hears it.

7
00:00:23.249 --> 00:00:27.294
Your child points to each word while reading. One finger, one word.

8
00:00:27.744 --> 00:00:31.971
Read the first pair together. Laugh at the silly one. That is part of it.

9
00:00:32.421 --> 00:00:38.563
For job two, press play on the sound track and step away. The voice waits, then reads each sentence.

10
00:00:39.013 --> 00:00:44.687
For these ten days, put away the books your child knows by heart. They come back after day ten.

11
00:00:45.137 --> 00:00:47.806
At the end, your child reads one sentence to you.
